    {
      "target": "Ischemic heart disease",
      "text": [
        "Heart disease and",
        "stroke cause more",
        "than a quarter of",
        "all deaths. But since",
        "they hit mainly older",
        "people, the cost in",
        "years of life lost is",
        "relatively small."
